SUMMARY:Drummer Boy
LOCATION:Garden Cinemas\, 361 Main St\, Greenfield\, MA 01301
DESCRIPTION:As America’s fight for independence begins\, a young drummer 
 boy\, an enslaved woman\, and a divided family each search for freedom in 
 a world built to deny it. With music carrying hope through battle and loss
 \, Drummer Boy turns the Revolution into a deeply human story of faith\, f
 orgiveness\, and the belief that no person is born to live in chains or be
  forgotten.\nhttps://www.gardencinemas.net/\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: ht
 tps://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.gardencinemas.net/
END:VEVENT
