SUMMARY:The Only Living Pickpocket in New York
LOCATION:Images Cinema\, 50 Spring St\, Williamstown\, MA 01267
DESCRIPTION:Times: 4:45pm\, 7:30pm\nHarry Lehman is an aging pickpocket who
  plies his trade with ever-diminishing returns in a drastically changed Ne
 w York. Wallets stuffed with cash have been replaced by easily cancelled c
 redit cards\, and Harry struggles to make ends meet as he cares for his di
 sabled wife\, Rosie. When he unwittingly purloins and fences a valuable US
 B stick\, Harry finds himself in a race against time to return the loot or
  face the rage of a vengeful crime family.\nhttps://www.imagescinema.org/m
 ovie/the-only-living-pickpocket-in-new-york\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: ht
