DESCRIPTION:Based on the life of Milton Hershey\, founder of the iconic Her
 shey chocolate company. Milton's grit and determination to conquer the wor
 ld of candy-making propel him from bankruptcy to monumental success\, and 
 the love of his life\, Kitty\, helps him build a legacy sweeter than any c
 andy bar. But when Kitty falls ill\, Milton’s wild optimism teeters on t
 he edge of destruction\, and she sparks an even bolder dream: to leave the
 ir fortune in the hands of America’s children in need.\nhttps://www.gard
 encinemas.net/\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
