SUMMARY:Dune: Part Three
LOCATION:Images Cinema\, 50 Spring St\, Williamstown\, MA 01267
DESCRIPTION:Times: 1pm\, 4pm\nNearly two decades after he seized control of
  the Imperium\, Paul Atreides is now a ruthless Emperor\, and must face th
 e consequences of his reign as old allies return\, terrifying new threats 
 emerge\, and betrayal lurks in every shadow. Haunted by visions of Imperia
 l collapse and the reappearance of his long-lost love\, Paul is drawn into
  a sweeping conspiracy\, with Chani at the heart of its unfolding mystery.
  As enemies close in\, Paul must confront the true cost of power and the f
 ate of those he loves the most.\nhttps://www.imagescinema.org/movie/dune-p
 art-three\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.imagescinema.org/movie/dune-part-three
END:VEVENT
